  "prefLabel": "He-W 573.12 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 573.12 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #8563, eff 2-7-06; ss by #10605, eff 5-23-14",
